	title = {Gearbox oil status recognition method based on PCA feature optimization and adaboost ensemble learning; 基于 PCA 特征优选和 AdaBoost 集成学习的齿轮箱油品状态识别方法},
	year = {2024},
	journal = {Journal of Electronic Measurement and Instrumentation},
